  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2602.02 \"Application\" means the form an applicant fills out to obtain a license to market or sell display fireworks, consumer fireworks or permissible fireworks.\n\nSource. #4983, eff 11-16-90; ss and moved by #5752, eff 12-2-93 (see Saf-C 2607); ss by #5801, eff 3-25-94, EXPIRED: 3-25-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
